Its author line reads "Research note prepared with OpenAI Codex".

Derived material (Apache License 2.0; full text in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Several parts of this repository are modified derivatives of OpenAI's openai/math repository
(https://github.com/openai/math, Apache-2.0). The commits used were
adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a and fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb.
Those parts remain subject to the Apache-2.0 terms. They are:

  05-lean-23-24/lean/QRH/, QRH.lean, ComparatorChallenges/
      Tree-shaken and hand-edited copy of the 23/24 closure of openai/math lean/ (via
      CoolRmal/quasi-riemann-seven-eighths@6ff3bd5), plus the new spine QRH/Spine/*.
  05-lean-23-24/lean/patches/
      Unmodified copies of openai/math lean/patches/*-lean4341.patch.
  05-lean-23-24/paper/, 05-lean-23-24/paper2-conversion/
      Exposition and converted paper derived from OpenAI's "The Quasi-Riemann Hypothesis"
      (paper2, 5 Oct 2026); large parts of the text are taken from it.
  06-kappa-bootstrap/lean/KappaFormal/
      Modified copies of openai/math lean/OAI/NumberTheory/DirichletL/Energy/* modules.
      They have no per-file "adapted" headers; this notice marks them as modified.
  08-weighted-numerator-10499-12000/lean/
      The submitted package. 48 of its modules are adaptations of openai/math modules and
      are marked as such. See 08-.../submission/NOTICE, UPSTREAM-NOTICE and
      third-party-notices/.

